  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and upskilling - agricultural sector education in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program, led by Yara Myanmar, aims at training Yaras employees so that they in turn can train small-farm holders in the correct use of fertilizers and fertile land to increase crop yields. The program aims at strengthening knowledge in light of food security and climate risk issues in Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
